## SAGA exit criteria

SAGA-02 completes when the bounded registry and admitted gauges preserve contracts, permissions, witnesses, and ceilings, and GTOC-3 machine-checks that every carrier change has a complete lift license or typed refusal.

## Surviving obstructions

* SAGA-01 construction is complete; no authority promotion is inferred.
* The S02-001 manifest and gauge schemas are closed only for the canonical JSON echo carrier.
* Broader Python conductor and provider inventories remain unreconciled.
* Cross-gauge conformance exists only for deterministic fixture and canned Codex model-profile replay.

* GTOC-3/S02-002 remains blocked until this sprint is merged and the host begins it separately.
